# Netlify Cache Control Headers
# Prevents index.html from being cached so users always get the latest bundle chunk hashes.

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

/
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate

# Static assets with content-hashes can be safely cached for a long time
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
